    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 81,
        "text": "Hi Lisa, did you finish the report on city transport for the planning meeting?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6f4911058e8dd9f44cb7dcd39c571133bebf6b9b534f129543a2534c67ff15b1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 85,
        "sourceEnd": 180,
        "text": "Yes, I did. But I had to correct some numbers. The car trips in 2010 were 300,000, not 350,000.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ba121c23f66b77fa7e84e387036e1fe91b4f9497c7a5d56f0ab277e5c28ff0e1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 184,
        "sourceEnd": 253,
        "text": "Right. And what about bus trips? I thought they were 120,000 in 2010.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7e7e2bd04f7f6a6375899abfd496031e0a70363cd52829dbf44cf476e6bdba8c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 257,
        "sourceEnd": 328,
        "text": "No, they were 100,000. The 120,000 figure is for bicycle trips in 2020.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "df8e5acee441d00ed9c6e972bf27e83f7f9fbac1377f52b688f4d1abcf7eb7ee",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 332,
        "sourceEnd": 460,
        "text": "Okay, thanks. So in 2020, car trips were 350,000, bus trips 80,000, and bicycle trips 120,000. And the subway had 150,000 trips.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ef1f252759de14fbf1e9cc6a166f781f4bdeada57477e214cac541ad09ea9834",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 464,
        "sourceEnd": 516,
        "text": "That's correct. The total was 700,000 trips per day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b90ce7bf32ad767bac23d084eb4e92cc269e94dfd8a6ac8040eddfb8b0701121",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 520,
        "sourceEnd": 571,
        "text": "The population grew from 500,000 to 700,000, right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0ddb908c483d33e05c523b75db51a484c0a9c542b5531058a9cda502970d4c38",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 575,
        "sourceEnd": 609,
        "text": "Yes, that's a 40 percent increase.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ecf19ae9518f461b7adb2d37f45ec4afe4846fae4b9bb3acc7646e7806f64c79",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 613,
        "sourceEnd": 700,
        "text": "And the government wants to double bicycle lanes by 2025. How many lanes are there now?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b99d8307f49375b5ec2dc9cafb1ec827e38aadf3cab7d0ce59ac6c232d3fe99d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 704,
        "sourceEnd": 798,
        "text": "Currently, there are 50 kilometers of bicycle lanes. They want to have 100 kilometers by 2025.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ff02647acef3675e1b152d03bdad7319630c0a996de1fd909289a03bcf03f6c2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 802,
        "sourceEnd": 894,
        "text": "And for buses, they want to increase trips to 160,000 per day. That's twice the 2020 number.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "46e6f2ff3bd8cf1535f4ca2e408bf307d3e720c4de09a93d662e1b005f5d2604",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 898,
        "sourceEnd": 962,
        "text": "Exactly. The goal is to make bus trips twice as many as in 2020.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9de15d760823e9c002b2dec91f9c8fc1b8ce794dc2186feb144ff1ca7f610b64",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 966,
        "sourceEnd": 1032,
        "text": "So the plan is to reduce car use and increase bus and bicycle use.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e89b952e3c7b1d917838b6c4f1c345ff64081c46636b417e20eff15e68b7083b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1036,
        "sourceEnd": 1097,
        "text": "Yes, and they hope the city will be cleaner and less crowded.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "56243cfa5269c2e9f8f10419cb47f21e8f80f89d9e1e9f228d1be565f6ed1c88",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1101,
        "sourceEnd": 1169,
        "text": "By the way, did you check the 2010 subway data? I couldn't find any.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "88066220549c04a968daaabedb766ae5301840f4367438545fea10402960edbb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1173,
        "sourceEnd": 1247,
        "text": "That's because there was no subway in 2010. The first line opened in 2015.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "48d885191ab41dad6ba350688c9a53c6151adc1a489ad92dbff866ee83baf49d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1251,
        "sourceEnd": 1289,
        "text": "Oh, I see. So the subway is quite new.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "bc31d9c90bdc8caa7dbd62654d8623931da146c188284572a6b3c8c6fc607177",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1293,
        "sourceEnd": 1405,
        "text": "Yes, and it's already very popular. In 2020, it had 150,000 trips per day, which is more than the bicycle trips.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bfb54026e740e9b151dea2afe1ba32b6a7bdc0e62069a66c050803a247924d29",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1409,
        "sourceEnd": 1460,
        "text": "Interesting. And what about the bus frequency plan?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b42e6a63e741df2842c5bae1abf6d24eee24303eaef8c6719f424bd0cfe0b261",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1464,
        "sourceEnd": 1556,
        "text": "They want to increase the number of buses on the road, so people don't have to wait so long.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d0d32f141852ea3ff8262caef0b786a9d187d929b2838d919b5392f3551460ac",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1560,
        "sourceEnd": 1610,
        "text": "That sounds good. I think the report is ready now.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7df046d3920cf8efc4f4c3ed642fdd3c191a73d36dfd8070f49a0c8701f020f6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1614,
        "sourceEnd": 1635,
        "text": "Yes, let's submit it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3f5fd722487ed9804af3b49ab81fe7232811decd64202adc4706a96ca708d8e0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
